The invoice total is calculated in **`invoice.ts`**, in the exported function **`total(items: number[])`**. It sums an array of line-item amounts using `Array.reduce`:

```ts
export function total(items: number[]) {
  return items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item, 0);
}
```

That's the only place totals are computed in this project.
